WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.934 --> 00:00:19.080
"Mom, can Jim come over?" asked Harry.

2
00:00:19.081 --> 00:00:22.073
Mom looked in Harry's room.

3
00:00:22.074 --> 00:00:26.715
His clothes were all over the floor.

4
00:00:26.716 --> 00:00:32.219
Toys and books were everywhere.

5
00:00:32.220 --> 00:00:35.374
"Yes," said Mom.

6
00:00:35.375 --> 00:00:40.631
"But first you must clean your room."

7
00:00:40.632 --> 00:00:44.570
Harry put his books on the bookshelf.

8
00:00:44.571 --> 00:00:48.598
He put his toy robots in a basket.

9
00:00:48.599 --> 00:00:53.487
And he hung his clothes in the closet.

10
00:00:53.488 --> 00:00:59.794
Soon Harry's room was very neat.

11
00:00:59.795 --> 00:01:03.399
Jim rang the doorbell.

12
00:01:03.400 --> 00:01:06.267
Harry opened the door for him.

13
00:01:06.268 --> 00:01:08.740
"Hey, Harry!" said Jim.

14
00:01:08.741 --> 00:01:12.696
"Hi, Jim," said Harry.

15
00:01:12.697 --> 00:01:15.119
"Come on in!"

16
00:01:15.120 --> 00:01:21.191
They went upstairs to Harry's room.

17
00:01:21.192 --> 00:01:24.158
Jim looked at Harry's books.

18
00:01:24.159 --> 00:01:28.374
He pulled a few of them off the shelf.

19
00:01:28.375 --> 00:01:35.740
Jim dropped the books on the floor.

20
00:01:35.741 --> 00:01:42.345
Next he picked up a model car.

21
00:01:42.346 --> 00:01:48.299
"This car is cool," said Jim.

22
00:01:48.300 --> 00:01:51.122
Jim poked the car's wheel.

23
00:01:51.123 --> 00:01:54.912
The wheel popped off.

24
00:01:54.913 --> 00:01:59.230
"Oops, sorry about that," said Jim.

25
00:01:59.231 --> 00:02:04.084
Harry sighed.

26
00:02:04.085 --> 00:02:11.243
"It's not a big deal," he said.

27
00:02:11.244 --> 00:02:15.563
Jim looked through the basket.

28
00:02:15.564 --> 00:02:19.890
He dumped toy robots on the floor.

29
00:02:19.891 --> 00:02:23.662
Soon Harry's room was a mess.

30
00:02:23.663 --> 00:02:28.523
Finally Jim went home.

31
00:02:28.524 --> 00:02:32.626
Harry looked at the mess in his room.

32
00:02:32.627 --> 00:02:35.504
"Ugh," he said.

33
00:02:35.505 --> 00:02:46.686
He started picking up his things.

34
00:02:46.687 --> 00:02:49.725
"What are you doing?" asked Mom.

35
00:02:49.726 --> 00:02:52.735
Harry sighed.

36
00:02:52.736 --> 00:03:01.998
"I'm cleaning my room—again!" he said.
